  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: da4a39d433d38c24d958ed2d45a0652e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 06_RecoverOxygenPlant
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SpaceGame.Gameplay.Objectives.RecoverOxygenPlantStep
  id: recover-oxygen-plant
  title: Recover the oxygen plant
  briefing:
  - Hold on. Cabin air is gone. The back door burst open when we hit, and the oxygen
    plant went out through it.
  - It's lying on the sand behind us. Lift it by the handle and carry it back to
    its mount. The crash will have cracked it, so take the soldering torch off the
    gear wall and close the seams, then give it a power cell.
  lookAtFocus: 1
  outsideStatus: Thrown out of the back door. Lift it by the handle
  carryingStatus: 'Carrying:  <b>{0:0} m</b> to its mount'
  damagedStatus: 'Damaged: solder the seams  <b>{0}/{1}</b>'
  powerStatus: Fit a power cell
  torch: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ad4dea599137eca49916333f41cce1fc, type: 2}
  torchRemark:
  - It's in, but the crash cracked it. See those glowing seams? Those have to be
    sealed before it will run.
  - There's a soldering torch on the gear wall. Take it with RMB, then hold LMB on
    the glowing seam until it closes. Three seams.
  beaconLift: 1.5
